         "member_revision": 1,
         "model_id": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
         "seat_id": "seat-chair",
         "status": "complete",
         "text": "The retried seat answers that the order should be quoted against the shop's worst week — 31 units — and priced as the sale of the right to refuse work, which puts 40 units a month above real capacity. This does not agree with the earlier costing answer, which treated the month's total as the capacity and made the decision turn only on margin; the disagreement is about which number describes the bench, and it is not resolved here.",
